# Provenance and attribution

This repository contains AGPL-3.0-licensed derivative works of the following
upstream projects, both public and both licensed under the GNU Affero General
Public License v3.0:

## chaitin/agent-compose
Upstream: https://github.com/chaitin/agent-compose

- `node_server/` — a Python port of the agent-compose node-control daemon
  (`pkg/agentcompose/api`, `pkg/storage/configstore/node_store.go`,
  `pkg/model/node_model.go`, `pkg/nodes/registry.go`, `pkg/auth/secretstore`,
  `pkg/nodescripts`, `pkg/agentcompose/api/*.go` stream handlers).
- `node_server/proto/agentcompose_v2.proto`,
  `node_server/agentcompose_v2_pb2.py` — the agentcompose v2 protocol schema
  and generated Python bindings.
- `nodes/` — an independent Go module whose `common/proto/agentcompose/v2`
  bindings are generated from that schema.

## chaitin/MonkeyCode
Upstream: https://github.com/chaitin/MonkeyCode

- `user-frontend/` — the MonkeyCode frontend, vendored as the C-side user
  portal (package upstream name: `monkeycode-ai`).

## Modifications

All files have been modified from their upstream forms: the Python port was
rewritten for this project's data-service split topology (NDJSON follow
streams, self-contained shared-store access, mobile-download pipeline), and
the frontend was rebranded and integrated against a compatible API surface.

Corresponding source for any distributed or network-served build of this
repository is this repository itself.
